     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: comparing options",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "比较商品时，除了价格和质量，你还会根据什么来判断？",
       "alumno": "When comparing products, what criterion would you apply besides price and quality?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "这个方案可能解决眼前的问题，却也会带来新的影响。",
       "alumno": "This proposal may solve the immediate problem, but it may also bring new effects.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "怎样区分直接影响和间接影响？",
       "alumno": "How would you distinguish direct effects from indirect ones?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "先观察短期结果，再跟踪后续变化。",
       "alumno": "First I would observe the short-term results and then follow the later changes.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果结果因情况而异呢？",
       "alumno": "What if the results vary depending on the circumstances?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "就要限定结论的范围，不能把个别情况说成普遍规律。",
       "alumno": "Then the scope of the conclusion must be limited, and an individual case must not be presented as a general rule.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: comparing options",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较商品时，价格只是一个标准。",
       "alumno": "When comparing products, price is only one criterion.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "还要核对质量、使用条件和售后服务，才能判断它是否真正合适。",
       "alumno": "You also need to check quality, conditions of use and after-sales service to judge whether it is really suitable.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "不同群体可能从同一变化中得到不同结果，所以不能只听一种声音。",
       "alumno": "Different groups may get different results from the same change, so it is not enough to listen to only one voice.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较各方的经历与证据，有助于解释各方结论为何不同。",
       "alumno": "Comparing the experiences and evidence of each side helps to explain why their conclusions differ.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果仍有疑问，应当承认，而不是把它们隐藏起来。",
       "alumno": "If doubts remain, they should be acknowledged rather than hidden.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
